edications, cabergoline 0.5 mg and fludrocortisone 0.1 mg, were effective in managing her condition. A comprehensive review of her symptoms and physical examination confirmed the stability of her adrenal insufficiency.\n\n2021-11-27: Christine's visit was focused on her adrenal insufficiency. She reported feeling tired and experiencing occasional lightheadedness. Blood pressure was l25/86 mmHg and her weight was 194 pounds. Her current medications (cabergoline 0.5 mg and fludrocortisone 0.1 mg) were effective. There were no significant changes her condition, and her adrenal insufficiency re"
